WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.297
Finance and operations Finance and operations are responsible for

00:00:05.363 --> 00:00:10.060
their own papers and decisions Daniel coordinates their inputs

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:13.178
and checks whether they are ready He does not

00:00:13.244 --> 00:00:16.863
approve specialist content simply because he assembles the meeting

00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:17.192
pack
